# Local immutable source copies and rendered verification evidence are retained
# on disk and hash-inventoried, but not duplicated into the Git checkpoint.
**/__pycache__/
audits/GIT_CHECKPOINT.md
audits/chunk-2/GIT_CHECKPOINT.md

# Portable handover: keep all authorized source PDFs and durable image evidence.
**/.DS_Store
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.tmp
**/*-journal
**/*-wal
**/*-shm
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
